Template: timeclock/instance-id
Type: string
Description: Clock name
 Installing erases every internal drive in this computer.
 .
 A short name for this clock's location, e.g. office: lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, starting with a
 letter or digit, at most 46 characters. It names the clock in alerts, logs and the database, and sets the
 hostname to timeclock-system-<name>. It can't be changed later.

Template: timeclock/clock-number
Type: string
Description: Clock number (1-99)
 Unique per clock. Clock n numbers the employees it adds n x 10000 + 1 to n x 10000 + 9999, so two clocks must never
 share a number. It can't be changed later.
